{"slug":"body-worn-camera","title":"Body Worn Camera","desc":"Body worn camera with emergency response. Don't just record incidents, respond to them immediately. See why our cameras are different.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/KS2_SER_on_white_4k_00007-scaled-e1759331792382.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Reveal Media Body Worn Camera\",\"title\":\"Body Worn Camera\",\"intro\":\"A body worn camera is an instant deterrent for potential verbal and physical abuse. The integration with Peoplesafe provides 24/7 support.\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/KS2_SER_on_white_4k_00007-scaled-e1759331792382.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"Incident support\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/icon-apps.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"More than just video recording\",\"heading\":\"Incident support\",\"content\":\"Give your people support during an incident instead of only recording it. The only solution that combines video recording and emergency response by pairing the body worn camera with our lone worker app.\",\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-e-book/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Audio monitoring\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/audio.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Active incident support\",\"heading\":\"Audio monitoring\",\"content\":\"When the body worn camera is activated, a separate SOS alarm is raised to the Peoplesafe Alarm Receiving Centre to actively monitor the incident.\",\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-e-book/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Overt and obvious\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/monitor-me2.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Instant deterrant\",\"heading\":\"Overt and obvious\",\"content\":\"The body worn camera is designed to be obvious to deter potential aggressors.\",\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-e-book/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-1-1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Evidence capture\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/record-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Audio and video\",\"heading\":\"Evidence capture\",\"content\":\"Video evidence will be recorded from the body worn camera when an SOS Alarm is raised to support the audio evidence recorded by the lone worker app.\",\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-e-book/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Training tool\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/training-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Upskill your staff\",\"heading\":\"Training tool\",\"content\":\"Video files from the body worn camera can be used as training aids for staff covering a range of difficult situations.\",\"linkText\":\"\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-e-book/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-5.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-3.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC). We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Overt protection for frontline workers\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-2.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Initially adopted by police and law enforcement agencies, body worn video technology is becoming increasingly popular in a range of sectors including healthcare, retail and security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a successful trial, body worn cameras are being rolled out to all 10 ambulance trusts in the UK three years ahead of schedule, such is their growing influence in protecting staff and achieving quicker prosecutions following serious incidents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition, the Metropolitan Police reported a 33% reduction in complaint allegations against officers and a high level of public support for body worn video technology to encourage transparency and improve security.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"How it works\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/BWC-4.png@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bluetooth triggers allow the body worn camera to be activated remotely via the Peoplesafe Pro <a href=\"/products/lone-worker-app/\">lone worker app</a>. With the integrated solution users can press the <a href=\"/uk/panic-alarms/\">panic alarm</a> button on their app, which will send a Bluetooth signal to the camera and trigger the camera to start recording. This frees the user from having to manually turn the camera on and ensures that video begins recording as soon as the user feels threatened, capturing evidence of the entire incident.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Having the Peoplesafe Pro app alongside the body worn camera provides audio monitoring of the situation and two-way communication with our 24/7 <a href=\"/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Body Worn Camera eBook\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download eBook\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-ebook/page/1?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/62c6d8afaf79b5e2b5423388.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how body worn cameras can enhance the safety and security of your workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product eBook for detailed information on its exclusive features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how the Peoplesafe app combines with Reveal body worn cameras to provide reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected in any situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/body-worn-camera-ebook/page/1?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download eBook</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"FAQs about the body worn camera and lone worker app\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What app can I use the KS2 body camera with?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe body worn camera is only available with the Peoplesafe Pro lone worker app, not the Peoplesafe app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Will having the body camera connected to the app drain phone battery?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo, the body worn camera is ready to receive a Bluetooth pulse from the app to start recording and doesn’t need to be constantly connected.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Will fall detection alarms automatically start recording?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, a Bluetooth trigger will be sent to the body worn camera to start recording. Similarly, the discreet alarm methods on the app will also trigger the camera to start recording.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Do people need to be informed that body worn cameras are being used?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIt is important to inform people that body worn video equipment is being used. When appropriate, it is good practice to have a public awareness campaign as well as appropriate workplace signage. The subject should be informed that they are being recorded with video as soon as is practical. The KS2 body worn camera has a front facing screen so anyone facing them will know that they are being recorded.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a body worn camera demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2022-12-22/2b7xtf\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":18,"types":["integrated-solutions"]}